-G96gr46qqyH68DiymJrnTaGBD-wWKPE4FCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsByJCd-JHlwL5Q6or4o2cBTFP14uWvw6qrps47w90Vtw&oe=699C4D02"}, {"file_name": "First Task - Step completed_2560x1440.png", "id": "1363251734687413", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393545_1363251738020746_5344844993909225465_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ajpC1KOrWcEQ7kNvwG18LLr&_nc_oc=AdmnsZ5g-YZ-_L7o48Lvb2Vi47nqtvs9gy5D6QzF2SW7zOTC5AcuDY8CLvOvnZuXvl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvIbSvbULQ3Rvk9x_mgyMkRni4a1EIO7Dna0YfB5y1SwA&oe=699C3BF0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "H-Verse", "keywords": [], "long_description": "H-Verse is the solution designed to improve various phases of business processes, with a focus on innovation based on specific needs. It is a product of Hevolus, an international leader in Extended Reality and Generative AI, specialized in creating unconventional phygital experiences.\n\nWith H-Verse app you can manage all the different scenarios available in Hevolus platform:\n- H-Store for retail, virtual shops, product presentation\n- H-Onboarding for new hire's experience\n- H-Collaboration for training and education\n- H-Fair for fair and exibitions\n- H-Project for real estate and interior design", "short_description": "H-Verse is a cutting-edge product within the Hevolus suite, designed to revolutionize the user experience by blending physical and digital elements. It offers customers a unique app for shopping experience, expands exhibition space digitally, catering to the presentation of complex products effectively, and much more."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hevolus.com/en/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hevolus", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hevolus.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags